<p> Egypt			236	236	  345	  345</p>
<p> Turkey		     837	837	  781	  781</p>
<p> China		    4,767    4,767	4,000	4,000</p>
<p> India		    2,686    2,584	2,435	2,435</p>
<p> Pakistan		 1,700    1,700	1,768	1,768</p>
<p> Uzbestan		 1,250    1,250	1,280	1,280</p>
<p> Other cen. Asia	  561	561	  521	  511</p>
